nded=\"false\" class=\"lg:hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:9999px;border:2px solid var(--color-ink);background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></header><main style=\"flex:1\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"Paws&Tales\",\"url\":\"https://paws-tales.com\",\"description\":\"Stories, science, and warmth — for everyone who shares a life with dogs.\"}</script><section style=\"background:var(--color-primary)\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 lg:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center\" style=\"max-width:1444px\"><div><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--color-ink);padding:6px 16px;border-radius:9999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px\">A friendly journal for dog people</span><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--color-on-primary);margin-bottom:24px\">Kindness, in every wag.</h1><p style=\"font-size:20px;color:var(--color-on-primary);font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:32px\">Stories, science, and warmth — for everyone who shares a life with dogs.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:var(--color-ink);color:var(--color-primary);border-radius:32px;padding:0 28px;height:56px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--color-ink)\" href=\"/blog\">Read the journal</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:32px;padding:0 28px;height:56px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--color-ink)\" href=\"/categories\">Browse categories</a></div></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"border-radius:32px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:5 / 4;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.18)\"><img alt=\"A happy golden dog running through a meadow\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450778869180-41d0601e046e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80\"/></div></div></section><section style=\"background:var(--color-canvas);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft)\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-10\" style=\"max-width:1444px\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-6\"><div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display)\">What can we help you with?</h2><p style=\"color:var(--color-muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:16px\">Pick a starting point — every guide is friendly, kind, and evidence-based.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4\"><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/training\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Training</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">Kind, evidence-based training so your dog grows into a confident companion.</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/understanding-your-dog\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Understanding Your Dog</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">Reading the signals, the science of doggy emotions, and what your friend is really telling you.</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/getting-a-dog\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Getting a Dog</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">From first thoughts to first walk home</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/health-wellbeing\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Health &amp; Wellbeing</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">Vet-reviewed guides on everyday care, warning signs, and life-stage health.</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms eas