ding\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4 / 3\"><img alt=\"Dog Organic Food Guide: What to Look for, Top Picks &amp; Feeding Tips\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537151608828-ea2b11777ee8?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=720&amp;q=80\"/></div><div style=\"padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1\"><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:9999px;padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase\">Health &amp; Wellbeing</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2;margin:0\">Dog Organic Food Guide: What to Look for, Top Picks &amp; Feeding Tips</h3><p style=\"color:var(--color-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden\">A practical guide to dog organic food: label criteria, top brand picks with prices, feeding amounts by weight, transition steps, and supplement advice.</p><span style=\"margin-top:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-muted);font-weight:500\">Anouk Beaumont</span></div></a><a style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease\" class=\"group hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]\" href=\"/health-wellbeing/how-to-get-rid-of-yeast-on-dogs\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4 / 3\"><img alt=\"How Do You Get Rid of Yeast on Dogs? A Complete Treatment Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\"